  "referenceNumber": "RUS1696",
  "remarks": "\nBrigadier General Abdollah MEHRABI is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 in that he is co-owner and former chairman of Oje Parvaz Mado Nafar Company (Mado Company) which has provided or made available for use by the Russian military components and engines for Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs) that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
